WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.360
A cleanup pass is easier to review when you
can see the measurements it started from.

2
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:12.383
Slash quality runs the installed CRAP
and Deadwood analyzers on this project.

3
00:00:12.383 --> 00:00:14.519
It hands the report to the agent,

4
00:00:14.519 --> 00:00:18.920
which starts checking whether a
suspected unused export has callers.

5
00:00:27.967 --> 00:00:30.545
Investigate the finding before editing.

6
00:00:30.545 --> 00:00:35.967
A passing check after the change gives you
evidence that the behavior still works.
